<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπέσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπερί-ττω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>CP</u>
			2.11.10
		</span></i>, later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπερί-πτω</span></b>  (q.
		v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>digest</i> food, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				141
			</span></i>:—esp. in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				756b11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕως ἂν καταπεφθῇ</span>
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τροφή</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Somn.Vig.</u>
				457b19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>digest, keep from rising</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χόλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.81
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πέψαι μέγαν ὄλβον</span>, i.e.
				<i>bear</i> great fortune <i>meekly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.55
			</span></i>.</div>
